# target: the other picture as it is (jp: black level of the off side corrected). input: video luma + 0.7-1.4 levels of white noise, 8 bit, dither removal.
# loss l1 + gradient l1. 6 convs 3x3, 16 features, relu, 9585 weights, 7036 steps, ema weights.
